WEBVTT

00:00:03.228 --> 00:00:04.688
Look alive, sunshine.

00:00:05.788 --> 00:00:08.308
109 in the sky, but the pigs won't quit.

00:00:08.668 --> 00:00:11.088
You're here with me, Dr. Death Defying.

00:00:11.288 --> 00:00:14.168
I'll be your surgeon, your proctor, your helicopter.

00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:17.168
Pumping out the slow-tomatic sounds to keep you live.

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:19.028
A system failure for the masses.

00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:21.208
Antimatter for the master plan.

00:00:21.468 --> 00:00:24.428
Louder than God's revolver and twice as shiny.

00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:26.788
This one's for all you rock and rollers.

00:00:27.048 --> 00:00:29.068
All you crash queens and motor babies.

00:00:29.248 --> 00:00:29.868
Listen up!

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:38.410
Ultra-secondary, do it now and do it loud, Gilderoy, make some noise!
